### FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator Using Gemini Models

### Project Testing Phase

### 1\. Introduction

The project testing phase ensures that the FitBuddy application works correctly and meets user requirements. It helps identify and fix errors before the application is launched.

### 2\. Objectives of Testing

* Check the functionality of the application.

* Identify and fix errors.

* Ensure accurate AI-generated fitness plans.

* Verify data security and system performance.

* Improve user experience.

### 3\. Types of Testing

* Unit Testing: Tests individual modules such as login, fitness plan generation, and progress tracking.

* Integration Testing: Checks the connection between the frontend, backend, database, and Gemini API.

* Functional Testing: Verifies that all application features work as expected.

* Performance Testing: Checks the speed and response time of the application.

* Usability Testing: Ensures the application is simple and user-friendly.

* Security Testing: Checks the protection of user data and secure API access.

### 4\. Test Cases

| Test Case              | Expected Result                        |
| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| User login             | User logs in successfully              |
| Profile creation       | User details are saved                 |
| Fitness goal selection | Selected goals are recorded            |
| AI plan generation     | Personalized fitness plan is displayed |
| Gemini API connection  | AI responses are received              |
| Progress tracking      | Fitness progress is updated            |
| Invalid input          | Appropriate error message is shown     |

### 5\. Error Detection and Debugging

During testing, errors such as incorrect inputs, API connection failures, slow responses, and database issues are identified. These errors are corrected to improve application reliability.

### 6\. AI Response Validation

The fitness plans generated by Gemini AI are checked for relevance, clarity, and safety. The application should avoid unsuitable exercise recommendations and provide appropriate safety warnings.

### 7\. Expected Testing Results

* All major modules function correctly.

* User details are stored properly.

* Gemini AI generates relevant fitness plans.

* The application responds efficiently.

* The system provides a smooth user experience.

### 8\. Conclusion

The project testing phase plays an important role in ensuring the quality and reliability of FitBuddy. Proper testing and debugging help create a secure, efficient, and user-friendly AI fitness planning application.
